<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 80px;
            background: #fff;
            color: #000;
            line-height: 1.4;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .column {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .left-col, .right-col {
            flex: 1;
        }

        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        p, li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        ul, ol {
            margin-left: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .placeholder {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            width: 100%;
            height: 300px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .placeholder::before {
            content: "[Diagram / Chart]";
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .signature {
            margin-top: 60px;
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .date {
            text-align: right;
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .center {
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
    <h1>[Document Header / Title]</h1>
</div>

<div class="column">
    <div class="left-col">
        <h2>[Left Column Title]</h2>
        <p>This is a sample placeholder block to simulate the exact spatial layout of the original document image.</p>
        <p>[illegible]</p>
        <p>Additional text lines for testing line spacing and justification alignment.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="right-col">
        <h2>[Right Column Title]</h2>
        <p>Side-by-side column content exactly as it appears in the source image layout.</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Bullet point 1</li>
            <li>Bullet point 2</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="placeholder">[Chart: positioned in right column]</div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="placeholder">[Centered diagram or image with caption]</div>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Column 1</th>
        <th>Column 2</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>[illegible]</td>
        <td>Text cell 2</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<div class="signature">
    [Signature / Name]<br>
    [Date]
</div>

<div class="date">
    [Document Date / Footer]
</div>

</body>
</html>
